                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testimonial-text">"The Grand Canyon Day Trip was absolutely life-changing! Our guide Jake was incredibly knowledgeable and made the whole experience feel safe and exhilarating."</p>
                    <div class="testimonial-author">
                        <div class="author-avatar">SM</div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Sarah M.</strong>
                            <small class="text-muted d-block">Denver, CO</small>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <div class="stars mb-3">
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testimonial-text">"We took the family on the Colorado River Float Trip and everyone from age 8 to 65 had a blast! Will definitely be back for the intermediate tour next summer."</p>
                    <div class="testimonial-author">
                        <div class="author-avatar">TJ</div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>The Johnson Family</strong>
                            <small class="text-muted d-block">Austin, TX</small>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <div class="stars mb-3">
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                        <i class="fas fa-star text-warning"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p class="testimonial-text">"The Westwater Canyon Whitewater tour was epic! Best adrenaline rush of my life. The guides are top-notch professionals. Already booked the Cataract Canyon Expedition!"</p>
                    <div class="testimonial-author">
                        <div class="author-avatar">MR</div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Mike R.</strong>
                            <small class="text-muted d-block">Boulder, CO</small>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA Banner -->
<section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container text-center text-white py-6">
        <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3">Ready for Your Next Adventure?</h2>
        <p class="lead mb-4">Book today and experience the magic of the Colorado River</p>
        <a asp-controller="Tours" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold">
            <i class="fas fa-calendar-check me-2"></i>Book Your Trip Now
        </a>
    </div>
</section>
